{"seq":2,"slug":"throughput-bottleneck-capacity-model","title":"吞吐建模、瓶颈分析与峰值容量规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/integration-throughput-ops/throughput-bottleneck-capacity-model","wordCount":2588,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"吞吐建模-瓶颈分析与峰值容量规划\">吞吐建模、瓶颈分析与峰值容量规划</h1><p>系统集成商签合同时承诺的是每小时 12,000 件，验收当天却只跑出 7,800 件——差额不是哪台设备坏了，而是设计时把「单机额定速度」当成了「系统吞吐」。WCS 的容量论证必须把输送线速度、分拣机格口节拍、AS-RS 出入库能力、PLC 循环周期和上游波次释放策略放进同一个排队网络里算，才能回答真正的工程问题：<strong>峰值订单量下，钱要加在哪一节链条上。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>**吞吐（throughput）**是单位时间内通过某节点的合格件数，例如件/小时（pph）或箱/小时（cph）；**产能（capacity）**是设备在无拥堵、无停机假设下的理论最大吞吐；**瓶颈（bottleneck）<strong>是限制整条链路吞吐的那个最慢或利用率最高的节点。三者关系由</strong>利特尔法则（Little&#39;s Law）**衔接：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是系统内在制品量（WIP），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是到达率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均滞留时间。对仓储自动化的意义是：当到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近瓶颈产能时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 会急剧膨胀——分拣口前堆积的包裹、AS-RS 前的待入库队列，都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 在替 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 发警告。</p>\n<p>一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 台并行服务台、单台服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的节点（如多条通往同一分拣机的汇流线），其近似排队延迟可用 VUT 公式（Hopp &amp; Spearman, <em>Factory Physics</em>, 3rd ed., 2011）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>μ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CT_q \\approx \\left(\\frac{c_a^2 + c_s^2}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\rho^{\\sqrt{2(m+1)}-1}}{m(1-\\rho)}\\right)\\frac{1}{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0544em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1273em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3573em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1273em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8043em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1273em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1274em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1274em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7258em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0369em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.4286em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4286em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:1.19em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0089em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4286em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.5429em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.5429em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4197em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda/(m\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是利用率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_a, c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是到达与服务时间的变异系数。这个式子给出的关键工程直觉：<strong>利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 超过约 85% 后延迟非线性上升</strong>，变异（波次释放造成的到达抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）会成倍放大延迟。所以仓储设计的「可用产能」从来不是 100%，而是给定的目标利用率上限。</p>\n<p>一次完整的吞吐论证包含六个动作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[定义峰值场景&lt;br/&gt;单量/结构/SKU数/时效] --&gt; B[建立节点排队网络&lt;br/&gt;每条链路的节点与并行度]&#10;    B --&gt; C[测单机能力&lt;br/&gt;额定速度 x 有效率 x 可用率]&#10;    C --&gt; D[逐节点算利用率 rho&lt;br/&gt;找 rho 最高者=瓶颈]&#10;    D --&gt; E[瓶颈前加缓冲/瓶颈后加并行&lt;br/&gt;或改波次策略削峰]&#10;    E --&gt; F[现场验证&lt;br/&gt;实测 pph 对照模型误差&lt;10%]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[定义峰值场景&lt;br/&gt;单量/结构/SKU数/时效] --&gt; B[建立节点排队网络&lt;br/&gt;每条链路的节点与并行度]\n    B --&gt; C[测单机能力&lt;br/&gt;额定速度 x 有效率 x 可用率]\n    C --&gt; D[逐节点算利用率 rho&lt;br/&gt;找 rho 最高者=瓶颈]\n    D --&gt; E[瓶颈前加缓冲/瓶颈后加并行&lt;br/&gt;或改波次策略削峰]\n    E --&gt; F[现场验证&lt;br/&gt;实测 pph 对照模型误差&lt;10%]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"从单机额定速度到系统有效产能\">从单机额定速度到系统有效产能</h2><p>设备手册上的速度几乎从不是可交付产能，中间要乘三个折减系数：**可用率（availability）**扣除故障与计划维护，**性能率（performance）**扣除降速与微停，**质量率（quality）**扣除误分与重投。这是制造业 OEE 框架在仓储的移植：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rated</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = C_{\\text{rated}} \\times A \\times P \\times Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一台额定 8,000 pph 的交叉带分拣机，若可用率 0.97、性能率 0.92、质量率 0.995，有效产能只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.97</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.92</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.995</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>7,104</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8000 \\times 0.97 \\times 0.92 \\times 0.995 \\approx 7{,}104</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.97</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.92</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.995</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">104</span></span></span></span></span> pph。再考虑分拣机不能 100% 满载（格口均匀度、上游供包节奏），工程设计通常按有效产能的 75%–80% 作为可持续运行点，即约 5{,}300–5{,}700 pph。</p>\n<p>不同设备的瓶颈机理差异很大，必须分别建账：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备/环节</th>\n<th>额定能力表达</th>\n<th>主要折减来源</th>\n<th>瓶颈触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输送线（单线）</td>\n<td>线速 × 件间距倒数</td>\n<td>积累/释放停顿、汇流让行</td>\n<td>汇流点合流率 &gt; 干线通过率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉带分拣机</td>\n<td>小车数 × 小车节拍</td>\n<td>供包节拍、格口满口反压</td>\n<td>单格口分配超载出现环流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑块分拣机</td>\n<td>载具节拍（含最小间距）</td>\n<td>载具回程、不可分件型</td>\n<td>大件/异形件占用节拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AS-RS 堆垛机</td>\n<td>双循环指令数 × 2</td>\n<td>深位取放、提升机共用</td>\n<td>提升机通道成为串行点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穿梭车系统</td>\n<td>层数 × 单车次</td>\n<td>换层提升、货位深度</td>\n<td>单层车次需求 &gt; 该层产能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拣选站（GTP）</td>\n<td>站位数 × 人均行数</td>\n<td>拣货、复核、换箱</td>\n<td>人效上限，非机器上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单机换算到系统时最常见的错误是<strong>沿链相乘</strong>：把每一级的额定速度乘起来代表系统吞吐。这只有在各级之间完美平衡且无排队时才成立。真实系统里，最慢节点决定上限（Amdahl 式的串行约束），而排队延迟又由最忙节点的利用率决定——这两个「最」往往不是同一个节点。输送线上利用率最高的汇流点可能是延迟瓶颈，而分拣机才是吞吐瓶颈，必须分开识别、分别处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瓶颈识别-利用率-损失树与约束理论\">瓶颈识别：利用率、损失树与约束理论</h2><p><strong>约束理论（Theory of Constraints, Goldratt, <em>The Goal</em>, 1984）</strong> 给出瓶颈治理的五步：识别约束、决定如何利用约束、让非约束服从约束、提升约束、回到第一步（约束会转移）。落到 WCS 的日常运维，识别阶段用两个工具。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>利用率热力图</strong>：把过去 7 天每个节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda/(m\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 按时段算出，最红的节点就是候选瓶颈。注意要按<strong>小时粒度</strong>而非日均——日均 60% 利用率的分拣机，在晚 8 点峰值可能是 115%，超额部分就是当日实际丢失的产能。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>损失树（loss tree）</strong>：把「本应达到的理论产能」到「实测产能」之间的差额逐层归因，通常分四层——计划停机（换班、清洁）、非计划停机（故障、卡件）、速度损失（降速、微停）、质量损失（误分、重投）。某电商仓曾把 22% 的产能缺口全部归给分拣机故障，损失树拆解后才发现其中 14 个百分点来自上游供包机在波次切换时的 3–5 分钟空档——<strong>瓶颈在策略，不在设备。</strong></p>\n<p>识别出瓶颈后，提升手段按成本从低到高排序，且必须遵循「非约束不得过度优化」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"improve_bottleneck(node):&#10;  1. 削峰: 调整波次释放曲线，把尖峰摊平 (成本最低)&#10;  2. 恢复: 消除该节点的非计划停机 (维护/备件/防卡)&#10;  3. 提效: 提高该节点利用率 (换包材/优化格口分配/减少换箱)&#10;  4. 扩容: 增加并行度或速度 (资本支出最高，最后考虑)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>improve_bottleneck(node):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 削峰: 调整波次释放曲线，把尖峰摊平 (成本最低)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 恢复: 消除该节点的非计划停机 (维护/备件/防卡)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 提效: 提高该节点利用率 (换包材/优化格口分配/减少换箱)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 扩容: 增加并行度或速度 (资本支出最高，最后考虑)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>前两步几乎不花钱，却常能回收两位数百分比的产能；直接跳到第四步买设备，往往只是把瓶颈推到下一个节点，同时留下前一个节点的闲置资本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"峰值容量规划与仿真验证\">峰值容量规划与仿真验证</h2><p>峰值规划的第一步是<strong>定义峰值</strong>，而不是「最大单量」。要用历史订单的<strong>峰值小时</strong>（而非峰值日）作为到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的输入，并区分三类峰值形态：日常晚高峰（可预测、可排班）、大促脉冲（如双十一零点、黑五，1–2 小时内翻数倍）、异常事件（系统故障后的补发、天气延误后的集中出库）。三者的容量策略不同——日常靠排班，大促靠预分拣与场地缓冲，异常靠降级预案。</p>\n<p>规划的目标不是让所有节点都能承接峰值，而是<strong>在可接受的延迟与成本下承接峰值</strong>。设峰值到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，瓶颈产能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，服务时间变异 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则峰值期间的平均在制品与延迟由排队模型给出（同上 VUT 公式）。工程上常用两条经验判据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>产能冗余度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = C_b / \\lambda_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：大促场景通常要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span>，日常场景 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 1.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.15</span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; 1.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.10</span></span></span></span></span> 时任何一次微停都会立刻造成队列外溢。</li>\n<li><strong>缓冲容量</strong>：瓶颈前的积累段长度必须足以吸收「到达脉冲宽度 × 到达率超出量」，否则溢出的包裹会绕过缓冲直接阻塞上游汇流点，把局部瓶颈放大成全链停摆。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正式投用前，容量方案应通过<strong>离散事件仿真（Discrete Event Simulation, DES）</strong> 验证。DES 把每个设备建模为服务台、把每件货建模为实体，随机抽样故障间隔（MTBF）与修复时间（MTTR）、到达间隔与波次释放曲线，跑出吞吐、延迟、在制品与队列长度的分布。相较于解析排队模型，DES 能捕捉汇流让行、格口满口反压、设备故障叠加这些解析式无法表达的交互。行业实践以 DES 作为投资决策的默认验证手段（来源：MHI <em>Annual Industry Report</em>，<a href=\"https://www.mhi.org\">https://www.mhi.org</a> ，历年均以「仿真与数字孪生」作为技术采纳首位）。</p>\n<p>仿真验证的三个硬要求：<strong>模型标定</strong>（用现有仓实测数据校准单机能力与故障参数，未标定的模型只是好看的曲线）、<strong>极端场景覆盖</strong>（不仅跑均值场景，还要跑「峰值 + 一台分拣机停机」的组合）、<strong>结果可复核</strong>（输出需给出置信区间或多次重复运行的分布，而非单次跑数）。</p>\n<p>上线后进入<strong>持续校准闭环</strong>：WCS/SCADA 的实时数据（分拣口计数、输送段落包状态、AS-RS 指令队列）回流到模型，按周对比实测与预测。若实测持续低于模型 10% 以上，优先怀疑波次策略变化或设备劣化，而非直接扩容。这个闭环把「一次性容量设计」变成「可演进的产能台账」——这正是 WCS 从控制层跃升为 WES（仓储执行系统）后所提供的近实时优化能力（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Warehouse execution system</em>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>系统吞吐 ≠ 沿链相乘的额定速度；瓶颈由「最慢节点」与「最忙节点的利用率」共同决定，二者常不是同一个节点。</li>\n<li>有效产能 = 额定 × 可用率 × 性能率 × 质量率；可持续运行点约为有效产能的 75%–80%。</li>\n<li>利特尔法则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 与 VUT 排队公式给出核心工程直觉：利用率超过约 85% 后延迟非线性上升，到达变异会成倍放大延迟。</li>\n<li>瓶颈治理按「削峰 → 恢复 → 提效 → 扩容」排序，扩容是最后手段，且要防止瓶颈转移后留下闲置资本。</li>\n<li>峰值规划用峰值小时定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，要求产能冗余度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 1.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.15</span></span></span></span></span>（大促 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span>），并用标定过的离散事件仿真验证极端场景。</li>\n<li>上线后持续用实测数据校准模型，实测偏离预测 10% 以上时先查策略与设备状态，再谈扩容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 内 <a href=\"../conveyor-sortation-routing/conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow\"><code>输送线拓扑与积放流控制</code></a> 解释缓冲段如何削峰，<a href=\"../asrs-goods-to-person-robotics/asrs-shuttle-lift-station-model\"><code>AS-RS 穿梭车—提升机—站台模型</code></a> 给出提升机这一常见串行瓶颈的设备级建模，<a href=\"../wcs-architecture-equipment-model/task-state-machine-idempotent-dispatch\"><code>任务状态机与幂等派发</code></a> 说明重试与幂等如何影响有效产能的可靠性折减。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"吞吐建模、瓶颈分析与峰值容量规划","id":"吞吐建模-瓶颈分析与峰值容量规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从单机额定速度到系统有效产能","id":"从单机额定速度到系统有效产能"},{"level":2,"text":"瓶颈识别：利用率、损失树与约束理论","id":"瓶颈识别-利用率-损失树与约束理论"},{"level":2,"text":"峰值容量规划与仿真验证","id":"峰值容量规划与仿真验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WMS-WCS 接口契约与消息协议映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/integration-throughput-ops/wms-wcs-interface-message-contract"},"next":{"title":"上线调试、可观测性与变更回滚管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/integration-throughput-ops/go-live-observability-change-management"}}